tests/ui/types/err_show_bad_unit_or_value.sky:5:12: error: unknown unit `c`
  |
5 | print(v as c)
  |            ^
  = help: `c` is a physical constant, not a unit; multiply by it: `x * c`

tests/ui/types/err_show_bad_unit_or_value.sky:6:7: error: cannot show a Bool in km
  |
6 | print(true as km)
  |       ^^^^ this is a Bool
  = help: only numbers and arrays of numbers can be shown in a unit

